In this folder you will find an almost full database of 
various hindcast generated with the wave model WAVEWATCH III.

Using google-earth, you can visualize the different grids and the output points:
IOWAGA_WWATCH_MULTI_output_points.kmz

You can also access to the data using the opendap service to help you getting what you exactly need : 
http://tds1.ifremer.fr/thredds/IOWAGA-WW3-HINDCAST/IOWAGA-WW3-HINDCAST.html

total size : 11.1T + 8.7T other
permissions on main directories : 2775 (drwxrwsr-x)
permissions on sub directories : 3775 (drwxrwsr-t)
***********
*ALTIMETER*
***********
area : Global grid
time : 1991 to 2016
info : ASCII and NETCDF formats with a file per sat
info : The satellite ids are : 1:ERS1 ; 2:ERS2 ; 3:ENVISAT ; 4:TOPEX ; 5:POSEIDON ; 6:JASON1 ; 7:GFO ; 8:JASON2; 9: CRYOSAT; 10: SARAL 
size : 58G
disk : mimosa:/export/home1/public/HINDCAST/ALTIMETER


********
*ARCTIC*
********
area : Arctic grid
time : 2013 to 2015
spatial resolution : curvilinear grid
lat : 31 to  89.9
lon :  0 to 360
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field - 3-hourly for spectral point
wind forcing : ECMWF
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : CFSR with homogeneous input IC1 and IC5
iceberg forcing : NO
info : still under development
size : 340G
disk : mimosa:/export/home1/public/HINDCAST/ARCTIC


