temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field - spectral point in ASCII 
wind forcing : ECMWF or NCEP (CFSR) depending on the directory
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : NCEP
iceberg forcing : NO
size : 200G
disk : mimosa:/export/home1/public/HINDCAST/ATNE


